---

## **What Happens After Railway Deployment:**

### **Before (With Ngrok):**
```
Your Computer:
├── Backend running (python main.py)
├── Ngrok tunnel (start_tunnel.py)
└── Need to keep both running

Frontend on Netlify → Ngrok → Your Computer
```

### **After (With Railway):**
```
Railway Server:
└── Backend always running

Your Computer:
└── Nothing needs to run!

Frontend on Netlify → Railway Backend (direct)